{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the chaos of the early 2000s retail scene in <strong>GameShop Simulator</strong> \u2014 a first-person or third-person co-op management sim where you run your very own video game store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock consoles, run the register, interact and answer customer questions, customize your shop layout, and deal with great and not so great customers. Work solo or enjoy up to a 4 person co-op, manage inventory, unlock licenses, decorate with giant cardboard cutouts, and maybe even survive a return request without a receipt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/a79706336fdbe7765b007a9994a4c1a8.poster.avif?t=1773928769\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/a79706336fdbe7765b007a9994a4c1a8.webm?t=1773928769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/a79706336fdbe7765b007a9994a4c1a8.mp4?t=1773928769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Order furniture, games, consoles, and accessories. Make sure to set the perfect price to maximize profits and customer satisfaction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/45d542263b31ab40dccf4375ba678cf0.poster.avif?t=1773928769\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/45d542263b31ab40dccf4375ba678cf0.webm?t=1773928769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/45d542263b31ab40dccf4375ba678cf0.mp4?t=1773928769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize your character with different outfits, hairstyles, or accessories.\u00a0<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/6034dfec061e401f32abde12d791ea06.poster.avif?t=1773928769\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/6034dfec061e401f32abde12d791ea06.webm?t=1773928769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/6034dfec061e401f32abde12d791ea06.mp4?t=1773928769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0Run the store with your friends! Remember, you're supposed to work together.  <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/f316c73af6ce811b92e1c98549746e11.poster.avif?t=1773928769\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/f316c73af6ce811b92e1c98549746e11.webm?t=1773928769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as