ster and get them sorted.\u00a0 <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/4b6da5bdf6a50f186b0959360473f3d4.poster.avif?t=1773928769\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/4b6da5bdf6a50f186b0959360473f3d4.webm?t=1773928769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/4b6da5bdf6a50f186b0959360473f3d4.mp4?t=1773928769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Place orders for your products and keep your shelves stocked! Keep an eye on your computer's email for the release schedule of any upcoming titles your customer's would want!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827330?t=1773928769","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827330?t=1773928769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/77a7037d1eb9908707d76a550992939af20ef4e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773928769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/77a7037d1eb9908707d76a550992939af20ef4e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773928769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Road Map</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827330/extras/579a175977cdb6b9e79a279f8b41a680.avif?t=1773928769\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamst